From 07bd5b97bb973479c32e68bbb036f9cec97eb3fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: buzz-host <buzz-host@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:37:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] buzz-host: start turns from operator wake files

A JSON file in $BUZZ_ACP_WAKE_DIR starts a turn: in a chat or thread's own
session when it names a channel (after any turn or queued message there), or
as an independent turn in a fresh session on the heartbeat path. The outcome
is written to results/<id>.json. Messages arriving in a chat during its wake
wait instead of steering into it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
